=== Interpretation ===
  If the enrichment of cross-disease pairs is concentrated in Q5 (the stratum most related to composition) 
  while within-disease replication holds from Q1 to Q5, 'shared signature = composition residual' holds.
  If cross-disease pairs are also enriched in Q1 and Q2, there is true sharing unrelated to composition.

